<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Weatherford raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Weatherford raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Albany said analyst Mike Smolinski upgraded Weatherford Enterra Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited strong first quarter results.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 earnings per share estimate to $2.14 from $2.10.</p>
<p>-- Has year-end price target of $42 on the stock, which rose 1-1/4 to 30-1/4.</p>
</text>
